like you have to do a audit of your

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:14.320
time.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.760
And I like the I like the quadrants, the

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:17.760
four quadrants of time management.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.600
There's the important stuff and the not

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:23.160
important stuff and there's the urgent

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:26.440
