00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:28.160
Working in the not urgent but important

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:31.040
stuff.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:33.480
Doing marketing, doing sales. That's

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:37.040
