00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:59.040
caught up in a what they feel like is a

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:01.680
productive cycle but it's not.

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:03.880
So if you do a if you do a time audit

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:06.920
and you're spending less than

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:08.680
30% of your time on the on the important

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:11.040
but not urgent stuff

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:12.360
sales, marketing, business development,

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.840
hiring

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:17.520
then you're not then you need to figure

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:19.120
out who for for five, six dollars an

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:21.480
hour sometimes can do a lot of that

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.200
other stuff that clears up time for you.

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.880
I

